     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">正常散佈圖會有多個點，有什麼方法可以標記每個點 的名稱<div><br></div><div><div><br></div><div>例如這樣</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-v1Znm2I0jGk/WHB_nYh870I/AAAAAAAACfI/PlcaG2xQ8j8nrkYCCEUhkrksBsOFts61gCLcB/s1600/im08_calb.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-v1Znm2I0jGk/WHB_nYh870I/AAAAAAAACfI/PlcaG2xQ8j8nrkYCCEUhkrksBsOFts61gCLcB/s1600/im08_calb.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237796286000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ulNHsBo5rbRluFjQVh_Jb\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-v1Znm2I0jGk/WHB_nYh870I/AAAAAAAACfI/PlcaG2xQ8j8nrkYCCEUhkrksBsOFts61gCLcB/s1600/im08_calb.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>但是我最終目標是想要這樣</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-tN2wa7ZJEWQ/WG-bcM0zlOI/AAAAAAAACew/xWhqq14qoyk0LwS4xBv3YHna7221rlVhACLcB/s1600/R1.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-tN2wa7ZJEWQ/WG-bcM0zlOI/AAAAAAAACew/xWhqq14qoyk0LwS4xBv3YHna7221rlVhACLcB/s1600/R1.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237796286000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2y226dFvf15QaPNCrRpvqm\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-tN2wa7ZJEWQ/WG-bcM0zlOI/AAAAAAAACew/xWhqq14qoyk0LwS4xBv3YHna7221rlVhACLcB/s1600/R1.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
