     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi friend,<div><br></div><div>Please try:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FXxEBJUprkk/WHEMiPUKooI/AAAAAAAALCk/1BvAhyOdm4URlKPrApCHm_rWmUfdRSK5gCLcB/s1600/ggplot2_group_text.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FXxEBJUprkk/WHEMiPUKooI/AAAAAAAALCk/1BvAhyOdm4URlKPrApCHm_rWmUfdRSK5gCLcB/s1600/ggplot2_group_text.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237796292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AlQpUgYAzu6hfU0b05p3H\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FXxEBJUprkk/WHEMiPUKooI/AAAAAAAALCk/1BvAhyOdm4URlKPrApCHm_rWmUfdRSK5gCLcB/s400/ggplot2_group_text.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: 群組圖+標籤</div><div># date: 2017.01.07</div><div><br></div><div>library(ggplot2)</div><div>mydf &lt;- data.frame(class=rep(c(&quot;dbms&quot;, &quot;mis&quot;), each=5),</div><div>                   club=rep(paste0(&quot;clu.&quot;, 1:5), 2),</div><div>                   len=c(80, 76, 65, 80, 81, 76, 85, 60, 78, 60))</div><div>row.names(mydf) &lt;- LETTERS[1:nrow(mydf)]</div><div><br></div><div>p &lt;- ggplot(data=mydf, aes(x=club, y=len, group=class, label=rownames(mydf))) +</div><div>  geom_line(aes(color=class)) +</div><div>  geom_point(aes(color=class))</div><div>p</div><div><br></div><div># Textual annotations</div><div>p + geom_text(size=6, nudge_x=0.2, nudge_y=0.5, aes(color=class)) + </div><div>  guides(colour = guide_legend(override.aes = list(size=1,linetype=1)))</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><br><br>王皓丞於 2017年1月6日星期五 UTC+8下午9時28分47秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
